Z||000000||Haze_Performance||07-05-2000||02:21 AM||||I should be getting my new GT wheels in a few days  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> (I cant wait) I went to the store and picked up a few cans of "Permatex Gasket Remover" In the blue can with a white cap.(#80646 4MA) is that the same stuff you used??<P>------------------<BR>Carl (85 Fiero) My Website's  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/HMP" TARGET=_blank>Haze Mustang Performance</A>   &  <A HREF="http://www.drive.to/WS6_Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero</A>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Oreif||07-05-2000||08:40 AM||||Yes, It is. Don't forget to get a small brass brush. Just spray it on and let it sit for about 15 minutes. I suggest using latex gloves so you don't get any on your hands. Also a small flat blade screwdriver for the holes in between the lugnuts. You'll see what I mean when you get the wheels.<BR>How about Saturday for dropping the hood off at your place?<P>------------------<BR>~Oreif~<BR>Fieroholic and proud of it!||||reg||1
